          "gap": 54,
          "padding": [
            78,
            84
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "Z1O88d",
              "name": "Why I Teach Desktop Quote Block",
              "width": 500,
              "height": 430,
              "fill": "#FFF8EC",
              "stroke": "#4A3026",
              "strokeWidth": 1,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 18,
              "padding": 34,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "D0wvwJ",
                  "name": "Why I Teach Desktop Kicker",
                  "fill": "#7B2D32",
                  "content": "04 — WHY I TEACH THIS WAY",
                  "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Mono",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "700",
                  "letterSpacing": 1.1
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "NPWfQ",
                  "name": "Why I Teach Desktop Quote",
                  "fill": "#2C211C",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "教材是工具，\n不是課程本身的目的。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.22,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Serif TC",
                  "fontSize": 38,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Wb02k",
                  "name": "Why I Teach Desktop Note",
                  "fill": "#7B2D32",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "The method serves the student — not the other way around.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.35,
                  "fontFamily": "Newsreader",
                  "fontSize": 20,
                  "fontWeight": "600",
                  "fontStyle": "italic"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "k4uFk1",
              "name": "Why I Teach Desktop Story",
              "width": 650,
              "height": 430,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 18,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "OgyRj",
                  "name": "Why I Teach Desktop Title",
                  "fill": "#FFF8EC",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "能持續學下去，\n通常不只是因為走完同一本教材。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.25,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Serif TC",
                  "fontSize": 38,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "w0jwc",
                  "name": "Why I Teach Desktop Body 1",
                  "fill": "#FFF8EC",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "長期教學後，我更確定：學生需要基本能力，也需要知道自己正在做什麼，並且能接觸真正喜歡的音樂。這三件事放在一起，學習才容易持續。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.75,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "500"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "CgTw5",
                  "name": "Why I Teach Desktop Body 2",
                  "fill": "#FFF8EC",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "因此，課程會依年齡、程度、過去經驗、目標與興趣調整。教材仍然會使用，但它服務的是學生的成長，而不是要求每個人都走完全相同的路線。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.75,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "500"
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "Xbrus",
                  "name": "Why I Teach Desktop Tags",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "height": 100,
                  "gap": 10,
                  "children": [
