            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "oFWFo",
              "name": "Why I Teach Mobile Kicker",
              "fill": "#FFF8EC",
              "content": "04 — WHY I TEACH THIS WAY",
              "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Mono",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "700",
              "letterSpacing": 0.8
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "p9S2H1",
              "name": "Why I Teach Mobile Title",
              "fill": "#FFF8EC",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "能持續學下去，\n不只是因為走完同一本教材。",
              "lineHeight": 1.24,
              "fontFamily": "Noto Serif TC",
              "fontSize": 30,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "nB1fq",
              "name": "Why I Teach Mobile Quote Block",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "height": 210,
              "fill": "#FFF8EC",
              "stroke": "#4A3026",
              "strokeWidth": 1,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 10,
              "padding": 22,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "pwtZq",
                  "name": "Why I Teach Mobile Quote",
                  "fill": "#2C211C",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "教材是工具，\n不是課程本身的目的。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.25,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Serif TC",
                  "fontSize": 27,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "mQ6q8",
                  "name": "Why I Teach Mobile English Note",
                  "fill": "#7B2D32",
                  "content": "The method serves the student.",
                  "fontFamily": "Newsreader",
                  "fontSize": 19,
                  "fontWeight": "600",
                  "fontStyle": "italic"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "cROOo",
              "name": "Why I Teach Mobile Body 1",
              "fill": "#FFF8EC",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "學生需要基本能力，也需要知道自己正在做什麼，並能接觸真正喜歡的音樂。這三件事放在一起，學習才容易持續。",
              "lineHeight": 1.65,
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
              "fontSize": 17,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "HDo52",
              "name": "Why I Teach Mobile Body 2",
              "fill": "#FFF8EC",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "因此課程會依年齡、程度、經驗、目標與興趣調整。教材仍然會使用，但不要求每個人走完全相同的路線。",
              "lineHeight": 1.65,
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
              "fontSize": 17,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            }
          ]
        },
